And so, everyone, hello!

100
00:09:23,786 --> 00:09:27,208
博衣こより生誕Live 2025にお越しください、ありがとうございます！
Thank you so much for coming to Hakui Koyori's Birthday Live 2025!

101
00:09:30,836 --> 00:09:35,808
