戸惑いも羽ばいた欲も 上手に誤魔化して 3年疾走 疾走 疾走
Skillfully brushing off confusion and soaring desires, running for 3 years, run, run, run

131
00:12:36,216 --> 00:12:41,816
p-w いっぱい言いたいことあるんでしょう 感情も切り替えて
p-w, you have lots you want to say, right? Switch your emotions too

132
