天よんでぐんぐん！まだまだ夢の向こうへ
Soaring high into the skies! Still beyond our dreams.

554
00:41:33,064 --> 00:41:37,064
no way どんな難題だっていいのさ ベストアンサーで弾き返せ
No way, whatever difficult problem, bounce it back with the best answer.

555
00:41:37,364 --> 00:41:40,564
へこたれたって最後まで全身全霊
Even if I get discouraged, with all my heart until the end.

556
