558
00:41:50,564 --> 00:41:54,064
いま いま sweet one more time!
now, now, sweet one more time!

559
00:41:57,064 --> 00:42:01,564
ぼくだけじゃない きみだけじゃない
Not just me, not just you.

560
00:42:09,064 --> 00:42:11,264
きみだけじゃない
Not just you.

561
00:43:30,064 --> 00:43:33,564
悔しくて嫌いになった
I grew to hate it out of frustration,

562
00:43:33,864 --> 00:43:37,264
消してしまいたいと思った
and wished I could just erase it.

563
