570
00:44:22,364 --> 00:44:26,564
乾いた心に震わぬ想いが溜まる
Unshakable feelings pile up in a dry heart.

571
00:44:31,064 --> 00:44:35,564
水面に映ったこの顔は嘘つきだ
This face reflected on the water's surface is a liar.

572
00:44:41,064 --> 00:44:42,564
聞いて
Listen,

